WEBVTT

NOTE
D-District Prison exterior. The walking prison stands on massive drill-shaped legs in a barren desert under blue sky.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A metal gangway extends between red industrial structures under bright desert sky.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Barren desert stretches to the horizon beyond the prison's concrete perimeter.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The camera tilts up. Three massive drill-shaped legs tower overhead, planted in sand.
